                                    <tr>
                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>Status Update:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_10712-7972351-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">      <p><b>2025-10-13</b>: <b>COMPLETED/ACCEPTED</b> w/ Service Owner and Advocate. Testing will validate fix on 2025-10-16.</p>

<p>POC: Ankit Goyal<br/>
Service: KMS<br/>
Remediation: Provide additional tooling to make the recovery mechanism safe and easy. <b>NOTE: This is already fixed. We removed all the admin endpoints that can lead to customer data loss.</b><br/>
Background: We have a defined process for recovery using our Snapshots. The team didn't attempt the recovery as it involved modifying the Kiev datastore directly using the KQT tool, which is a dangerous operation. </p>
  </td>
            </tr>
                                                                    <tr>
