                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>Recommendation:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_18605-7972351-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">      2025-10-07: COMPLETED/CONFIRMED w/ Service Owner and Advocate.   Testing will validate fix on 10/16.<br/>
<br/>
POC:  Ankit Goyal<br/>
Service: KMS<br/>
Remediation:  Provide additional tooling to make the recovery mechanism safe and easy.  NOTE:  This is already fixed. We removed all the admin endpoints that can lead to customer data loss.<br/>
Background: We have a defined process for recovery using our Snapshots. The team didn&#39;t attempt the recovery as it involved modifying the Kiev datastore directly using the KQT tool, which is a dangerous operation.
  </td>
            </tr>
