    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>The KMS team identified that accidental deletion of either cloud-managed or customer-managed vaults results in instant, total loss of access to all dependent data. Although recovery is theoretically possible via the 60-day soft-delete window, it requires the customer to notice in time, open a Sev-1 ticket, and the KMS team to complete a complex, multi-step manual restore. Failures at any step could result in permanent data loss. </p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

